<Layout page="privacy">
<main class="page active" id="page-privacy">
<div class="section" style="padding-top: 120px;">
<div class="container">
<div class="prose">
<div class="section-eyebrow">Legal</div>
<h1 class="h1" style="margin-bottom:32px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Last updated: June 2025</p>
<h2>What We Collect</h2>
<p>This website does not collect personal data beyond what you voluntarily provide through the contact form. No cookies are set. No analytics trackers are embedded.</p>
<h2>Contact Form Data</h2>
<p>When you submit the contact form, your name, email, and message are transmitted via email. This data is used solely to respond to your inquiry and is not shared with third parties.</p>
<h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
<p>This site links to GitHub, Instagram, WhatsApp, and LinkedIn. Those platforms have their own privacy policies which govern your use of those services.</p>
<h2>Your Rights</h2>
<p>You may request deletion of any personal data you've submitted by contacting cian@kiankhayat.me.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>For any privacy-related questions, reach out at <a href="mailto:cian@kiankhayat.me" style="color:var(--accent-ink);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px">cian@kiankhayat.me</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</main>
</Layout>
